Chapter: DataTableFitTest

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites UI chapter DataTable

 WORKS-23. A table paginates on the height it was given instead of on a
 guess, so it stops laying rows out on top of its own header.

 The arms are paired: a tall box takes more rows than a short one, a box too
 short for even one row still gets one rather than zero, and the page a
 reader is on is pulled back into range when the box GROWS under it. That
 last one is the arm that matters, and the direction is the unobvious half:
 growing the box makes FEWER pages, so a reader parked on a later page is
 left outside the range the count declares and the table shows nothing.

 The grown box is 700 rather than 400 because `data-table-row-h` and
 `data-table-chrome-h` moved with WORKS-45. At 400 the grown box now holds
 seven of the fourteen rows, page 1 stays inside the range, and the arm puts
 its question to a table with nothing to pull back.

Section: Fixtures

  cols : List TableColumn = [table-column "k" "Key" 60, table-column "t" "Title" 200]

  rows-n : Integer, Integer, List TableRow -> List TableRow
  rows-n (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else rows-n (i + 1) n (acc & [table-row (show (i + 1)) [show (i + 1), "row " & show (i + 1)]])

  table-of : Integer -> DataTableState
  table-of (n) = data-table-new "t" cols (rows-n 0 n [])

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
    print-line-uni ("rows that fit, 200px: " & show (data-table-rows-that-fit 200))
    print-line-uni ("rows that fit, 100px: " & show (data-table-rows-that-fit 100))
    print-line-uni ("rows that fit, 50px:  " & show (data-table-rows-that-fit 50))
    print-line-uni ("rows that fit, 0px:   " & show (data-table-rows-that-fit 0))

    print-line-uni ("14 rows in 200px: page size " & show ((data-table-fit (table-of 14) 200).dt-page-size) & ", pages " & show (data-table-page-count (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 200)))
    print-line-uni ("14 rows in 100px: page size " & show ((data-table-fit (table-of 14) 100).dt-page-size) & ", pages " & show (data-table-page-count (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 100)))
    print-line-uni ("14 rows in 200px shows " & show (list-length (data-table-visible-rows (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 200))))
    print-line-uni ("14 rows in 100px shows " & show (list-length (data-table-visible-rows (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 100))))
    print-line-uni ("no rows in 100px: pages " & show (data-table-page-count (data-table-fit (table-of 0) 100)) & ", shows " & show (list-length (data-table-visible-rows (data-table-fit (table-of 0) 100))))

    print-line-uni ("the box GROWS under a reader on a later page, page: " & show ((data-table-fit (data-table-page-next (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 100)) 700).dt-page))
    print-line-uni ("and the page it is pulled back to shows " & show (list-length (data-table-visible-rows (data-table-fit (data-table-page-next (data-table-fit (table-of 14) 100)) 700))))
  end
